<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR FEELING</view><view class="title">先选心动的感觉。</view><view class="chips"><button class="chip {{collection===item.slug?'active':''}}" wx:for="{{collections}}" wx:key="slug" data-id="{{item.slug}}" bindtap="chooseCollection">{{item.zh}}</button></view><view class="chips"><button class="chip {{style===item.id?'active':''}}" wx:for="{{styles}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseStyle">{{item.zh}}</button></view><view class="gallery"><view class="photo" wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="id"><image src="{{item.src}}" mode="aspectFill" lazy-load data-src="{{item.src}}" bindtap="preview"/></view></view><view wx:if="{{!photos.length}}" class="notice">这个组合暂未公开样片，可以切换风格，或向 Hannah 询问更多作品。</view><button class="button" bindtap="book">带着这个风格，计划拍摄 ↗</button><view class="muted space">风格分类用于沟通方向，具体效果取决于光线、场地与造型。可以在询单中补充喜欢的参考。</view></view>
